### FEDFUNDS(금리)
GET https://{{BASE_URL}}/fred/series/observations
    ?series_id=FEDFUNDS
    &api_key={{API_KEY}}
    &file_type=json
    &observation_start=2015-06-01

### T10Y2Y(장단기 금리차)
